# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Only Assets/CVR.CCK ships in the release zip — everything else
# under Assets/ is local project content and stays out of git.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
Assets/*
!Assets/CVR.CCK/

# Package payload dependencies live outside Assets/ or are resolved
# by VCC at install time; keep only the manifests for reference.
Packages/*
!Packages/manifest.json
!Packages/packages-lock.json

# Reference copies of the official CCK kept for diffing.
Official/

# Stray asset folders dropped at the project root.
Poi/
Thry/
